":"top"},{"id":"vision-internal","from":"vision","to":"internal","label":"IN/OUT RGB · pixel/result · validated","variant":"dashed","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"right"},{"id":"bridge-internal","from":"bridge","to":"internal","label":"Python object attachment / method calls","variant":"dashed","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","route":"straight"},{"id":"internal-amr","from":"internal","to":"amr","label":"agent articulation / lift control","variant":"dashed","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","route":"straight"},{"id":"sensor-amr","from":"sensor","to":"amr","label":"ROS graph I/O / actuation","fromSide":"right","toSide":"bottom","via":[[1080,1030],[1280,1030],[1280,908]]}],"cards":[{"dot":"cyan","title":"Runtime boundaries","items":["Web / Host ROS 2 / Isaac Sim are logical execution regions; this diagram does not claim three physical PCs.","ProcessEquipmentBridge and P3020/IW-Hub agents are Python objects in Isaac, not independent ROS nodes."]},{"dot":"emerald","title":"Control responsibility","items":["ros2_manual_mqtt_adapter publishes manual velocity only.","ros2_mqtt_adapter owns MQTT-driven navigation plus manual lift command/state bridging.","amr_p3020_mission drives lift-related mission phases through /amr_a/pickup_command values such as LOWER_AT_DELIVERY and RAISE_AT_DELIVERY; it is not the /lift_command publisher."]},{"dot":"rose","title":"Mission conditions","items":["PickPlace Action is used when simulate_p3020=false; default is simulate_p3020=true.","manual_delivery=true waits for /amr_a/p3020_arrival_confirm; default manual_delivery=false follows Nav2 delivery arrival."]},{"dot":"cyan","title":"Navigation / pose scope","items":["Nav2 ↔ IW Hub ROS2 Graphs is shown at control/sensor-flow level. Exact topic remaps and TF broadcasters require runtime graph/external iw_hub_navigation configuration to confirm.","pose_sync_manager looks up map→base_link for consistency; this diagram does not assert a single TF publisher."]},{"dot":"emerald","title":"Vision scope","items":["Active Mission vision uses separate P3020 IN/OUT detector nodes: RGB/preview → detector, pixel/result → Isaac agent, validated → detector HUD.","Legacy locate_box service/relay exists in the repository but /box_position_camera is not shown as an active main_mission runtime edge."]}]}